        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 343,
        "headingId": 764,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Poikilodermatous plaque-like haemangioma is an acquired band-like vascular proliferation involving the superficial dermis.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T12:03:28"
      }
    ],
